From 9490d4abf66ea6c15f254d166a2765819efaea51 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 22:01:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Allow explicit scratch source initial attachment at
 ending tools

Reuse the dispatcher-bound registration and receipt pipeline for complete, review, block, schedule, continue and move. Attach before artifact staging; preserve pending observations, immutable identities and implementation-only claims. Reject capability routing combinations rather than silently discarding explicit source. Replays validate identity without resending revision-zero attach after publication.

Proof: disabled-boundary RED; six-ending composed publication and receipt controls, all source consumers 700 passed across 42 files, docs drift included; three focused mutants killed with clean baseline; full check 21 passed on own diff. Short independent code review findings addressed. Live ending-initial rollout acceptance remains separately owned by this card.
---
