 tools/kanban_tools_schemas.py                 |  16 ++
 tools/kanban_tools_source.py                  |  15 ++
 website/docs/user-guide/features/kanban.md    |  16 +-
 7 files changed, 356 insertions(+), 30 deletions(-)
